10744	The Argun or Ergune is a 1,621 kilometres  river that forms part of the eastern China–Russia border, together with the Amur River . Its upper reaches are known as Hailar River  in China. The Ergune marks the border  between Russia and China for about 944 kilometres , until it meets the Amur River.
